sequenceDiagram
    participant Producer as Producer Client<br/>(SDK)
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey<br/>6379/TCP
    participant AP as Async Processor<br/>(Worker Pool)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>9090/TCP HTTP
    participant IGW as llm-d-router<br/>(Inference Gateway)
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>gRPC

    Note over Producer,OTLP: Flow 1: Async Inference Request Processing

    Producer->>Redis: ZADD request to sorted set<br/>Redis Protocol / Optional TLS<br/>URL credentials
    Note right of Producer: Request includes: payload,<br/>deadline, metadata, headers,<br/>W3C traceparent

    Redis-->>AP: Poll: BZPOPMIN from queue<br/>Redis Protocol / Optional TLS<br/>URL credentials
    Note right of AP: Flow delivers per-queue<br/>channels to MergePolicy

    Note over AP: MergePolicy merges queues<br/>(random-robin or tier-priority<br/>with 6 strict lanes)

    Note over AP,Prom: Flow 2: Dispatch Gate Evaluation

    AP->>Prom: PromQL query (saturation/budget)<br/>HTTP / No Auth
    Prom-->>AP: Metric values

    AP->>Redis: Check quota/budget keys<br/>Redis Protocol / Optional TLS
    Redis-->>AP: Quota status

    alt Gate verdict: Admit
        AP->>IGW: POST inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS / Optional TLS 1.2+ / mTLS<br/>OTel-instrumented transport
        Note right of AP: Includes fairness headers,<br/>W3C traceparent propagation
        IGW-->>AP: Inference response<br/>(status code + payload)

        AP->>Redis: ZADD result to result set<br/>Redis Protocol / Optional TLS
        Note right of AP: Result includes: StatusCode,<br/>Payload, ErrorCode, ErrorMessage

        Producer->>Redis: Poll result (BZPOPMIN)<br/>Redis Protocol / Optional TLS
        Redis-->>Producer: ResultMessage
    else Gate verdict: Wait
        Note over AP: Worker parks in-memory<br/>(up to gate-wait-timeout: 5m)
        AP->>Prom: Re-evaluate gate condition
        Prom-->>AP: Updated metrics
        Note over AP: Retry dispatch after wait
    else Gate verdict: Refuse
        Note over AP: Message returned to broker<br/>immediately for redelivery
        AP->>Redis: Re-enqueue message
    end

    AP->>OTLP: Export trace spans<br/>gRPC / Optional TLS
    Note right of AP: Spans: dispatch, gate-eval,<br/>request, re-enqueue (linked)

    Note over AP: Graceful Shutdown Sequence
    Note over AP: 1. SIGTERM received
    Note over AP: 2. Health /readyz → 503
    Note over AP: 3. Stop message consumption
    Note over AP: 4. Drain in-flight (drain-timeout: 2m)
    Note over AP: 5. Re-enqueue remaining with linked span
